The Hivemother is an insectoid creature some eighty feet long, coiled around the central pillar of a cathedral room in the forsaken sector of [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei|Iomenei]]. It breeds the [[Bestiary/Swarm Child|swarm children]], emitting them as it is watched, and a horn grows from its mouth. Its brood had claimed the room around it.

The party came into the room hunting the saboteur [[People/Gerhard|Gerhard]], and [[People/Barlow Crane|Barlow Crane]], [[People/Grant FireEye|Grant FireEye]], [[People/Gage|Gage]] and [[Org/Velvet Mark/People/Archie|Archie]] killed it. When it was split in two, every other insect in the room collapsed where it stood. It was a different kind of bug from the swarm children, and there was no sign of Gerhard in the room, which implied that more of the insects had taken root elsewhere in the city.
